==== OEM installation ====

The OpenWrt ''-factory'' images can be flashed from the stock firmware's web interface (only the latest stock firmware, v1.0.1.8, has
been tested).

For information on how to enable telnet (not required to flash the image), see [[toh:netgear:telnet.console|Unlocking the Netgear Telnet Console]].



